        "quote": "您已经做得非常到位了，现在我帮您把回家后的关键事项整理成一张清晰的执行清单，您照着做就行："
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "Closure includes specific actions, responsible parties, and timing; residual risks are appropriately carried.",
