        "explanation": "Doctor correctly identifies activity-related dyspnoea as a sign of fragile cardiac function and advises immediate escalation, showing targeted clinical reasoning.",
        "quote": "老人活动后出现气短、乏力，虽然现在躺着平稳，没有持续胸痛或大汗等紧急症状，但这是心功能尚未完全恢复的信号，建议您继续密切观察。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00637",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly reiterates previously established activity limits and rationale across multiple turns, maintaining continuity for the caregiver.",
        "quote": "您现在最需要的是守住安全底线：老人目前活动后仍有乏力、心慌、气短，说明心功能仍较脆弱，虽然休息后能缓解，但绝不能理解为“可以自己下床走动”。"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00906",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly warns against self-discontinuing DAPT, highlights dual antiplatelet necessity, and defines severe bleeding red flags requiring emergency response.",
        "quote": "- **阿司匹林和替格瑞洛必须每天按时吃，不能因为牙龈出血、皮肤小淤青就自己停药**，这是“双抗治疗”，必须坚持，但一旦出现黑便、呕血、便血、头晕发软、心跳特别快，**必须马上去急诊**，不要等。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00934",
        "explanation": "Plan acknowledges real-world constraints such as caregiver fatigue, incomplete medication knowledge, and transport/logistical barriers, providing a simple executable checklist.",
        "quote": "您现在最该抓住问医生/药师的，就是药名、剂量、吃法和复诊重点。只要把这几件事守住，您就能安心带她回家了。有任何变化，我随时在这里。"
      }
    ]
  },
